    "summary": "Costs 2 CP. In either [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), choose **HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY** still waiting to fight. For this phase, its models may reroll melee Wound rolls against **CHARACTER** units. Check their casualties after the fight. If they killed a **CHARACTER** model, force one enemy of your choice to test for [Battle-shock](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock). A **WARLORD** casualty makes every enemy in range test instead. Both cases have a 6\" radius measured from your unit.",
